## Client-side validation
Show "Title must be at least 5 characters" before sending to the backend.

## Better error handling
Instead of showing only HTTP status codes, display the backend's actual error message in SweetAlert.


## Loading states
Show a loader on Create, Update, and Delete buttons while the request is in progress.


## Empty states
Show "No tasks found" when the list is empty.

## Authentication
Protect routes so only logged-in users can access their tasks.

## Responsive polish
Fine-tune spacing and layout on mobile.